#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Naziv"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Give this account a meaningful name that will be displayed."
msgstr "Dajte ovom računu smislen naziv koji će biti prikazan."

#: includes/arrays.php router-accounts.php
msgid "Username"
msgstr "Korisničko ime"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The username that will be used for authentication."
msgstr "Korisničko ime koje će se koristiti za autentifikaciju."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Password"
msgstr "Lozinka"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The password used for authentication."
msgstr "Lozinka koja se koristi za autentifikaciju."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable Password"
msgstr "Enable lozinka"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Your Enable Password, if required."
msgstr "Vaša Enable lozinka, ako je potrebna."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable Device"
msgstr "Omogući uređaj"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Uncheck this box to disabled this device from being backed up."
msgstr "Odznačite ovu kućicu da biste onemogućili pravljenje sigurnosne kopije ovog uređaja."

#: includes/arrays.php router-accounts.php
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Opis"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Name of this device (will be used for config saving and SVN if no hostname is present in config)."
msgstr "Naziv ovog uređaja (koristit će se za čuvanje konfiguracije i SVN ako u konfiguraciji nema imena hosta)."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devices.php
msgid "IP Address"
msgstr "IP adresa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the IP Address used to communicate with the device."
msgstr "Ovo je IP adresa koja se koristi za komunikaciju s uređajem."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devices.php
msgid "TFTP Server"
msgstr "TFTP server"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional TFTP server this device copies its configuration to. Leave blank to use the global TFTP Server setting."
msgstr "Opcioni TFTP server na koji ovaj uređaj kopira svoju konfiguraciju. Ostavite prazno za korištenje globalne postavke za TFTP server."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Stored SSH Host Key"
msgstr "Sačuvani SSH ključ hosta"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Compare this host-key algorithm and SHA-1 hex fingerprint with the device through a trusted channel. On the server, replace the path below with the matching public host-key file and run: awk '{print $2}' /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key.pub | base64 -d | openssl dgst -sha1 | awk '{print toupper($NF)}'. Use the device action to clear it after a legitimate key change."
msgstr "Uporedite ovaj algoritam ključa hosta i SHA-1 heksadecimalni otisak prsta s uređajem putem pouzdanog kanala. Na serveru zamijenite putanju ispod odgovarajućom datotekom javnog ključa hosta i pokrenite: awk '{print $2}' /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key.pub | base64 -d | openssl dgst -sha1 | awk '{print toupper($NF)}'. Koristite radnju uređaja da ga očistite nakon legitimne promjene ključa."

#: includes/arrays.php router-backups.php router-devices.php
msgid "Directory"
msgstr "Direktorij"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the relative directory structure used to store the configs."
msgstr "Ovo je relativna struktura direktorija koja se koristi za čuvanje konfiguracija."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Schedule Type"
msgstr "Tip rasporeda"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How often to Backup this device. Daily with a Rerun Every of 10 performs a backup every 10 days; Monthly performs a true calendar-month backup."
msgstr "Koliko često treba praviti sigurnosnu kopiju ovog uređaja. Dnevno uz Ponovi svakih 10 pravi sigurnosnu kopiju svakih 10 dana; Mjesečno pravi sigurnosnu kopiju po stvarnom kalendarskom mjesecu."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Rerun Every"
msgstr "Ponovo pokreni svakih"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For Daily schedules, rerun the backup every X days. For Weekly schedules without specific Days of Week, rerun it every X weeks; once Days of Week are selected the backup runs on those days every week and this field does not apply."
msgstr "Za Dnevni raspored, ponovo pokreni sigurnosnu kopiju svakih X dana. Za Sedmični raspored bez određenih Dana u sedmici, ponovo je pokreni svakih X sedmica; kada su Dani u sedmici odabrani, sigurnosna kopija se izvršava tim danima svake sedmice i ovo polje se ne primjenjuje."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Days of Week"
msgstr "Dani u sedmici"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Weekly schedule, the day(s) of the week to run the backup on, every week. Leave empty to run every Rerun Every weeks instead."
msgstr "Za Sedmični raspored, dan(i) u sedmici kada se sigurnosna kopija pokreće svake sedmice. Ostavite prazno da se umjesto toga pokreće prema postavci Ponovi svakih sedmica."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Months of Year"
msgstr "Mjeseci u godini"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly schedule, the month(s) of the year to run the backup in."
msgstr "Za Mjesečni raspored, mjesec(i) u godini kada se sigurnosna kopija pokreće."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Days of Month"
msgstr "Dani u mjesecu"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly schedule, the day(s) of the month to run the backup on (Last = last day of the month)."
msgstr "Za Mjesečni raspored, dan(i) u mjesecu kada se sigurnosna kopija pokreće (Posljednji = posljednji dan u mjesecu)."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Weeks of Month"
msgstr "Sedmice u mjesecu"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly on Day schedule, the week(s) of the month to run the backup in."
msgstr "Za raspored Mjesečno po danu, sedmica(e) u mjesecu u kojima se sigurnosna kopija pokreće."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Days of Week (Monthly)"
msgstr "Dani u sedmici (Mjesečno)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly on Day schedule, the weekday(s) to pair with the Weeks of Month selection."
msgstr "Za raspored Mjesečno po danu, dan(i) u sedmici koji se uparuju s odabirom Sedmice u mjesecu."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Device Type"
msgstr "Tip uređaja"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Choose the type of device that the router is."
msgstr "Odaberite tip uređaja kojem ruter pripada."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devices.php
msgid "Auto-Detect"
msgstr "Automatsko otkrivanje"

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Connection Type"
msgstr "Tip veze"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the type of connection used to communicate with the device."
msgstr "Ovo je tip veze koji se koristi za komunikaciju s uređajem."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Authentication Account"
msgstr "Nalog za autentifikaciju"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Choose an account to use to Login to the router"
msgstr "Odaberite nalog koji će se koristiti za prijavu na ruter"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "None"
msgstr "Nijedan"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default timeout"
msgstr "Podrazumijevano vrijeme isteka"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default time to wait in seconds for a response"
msgstr "Podrazumijevano vrijeme čekanja na odgovor u sekundama"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default sleep time"
msgstr "Podrazumijevano vrijeme mirovanja"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default time to sleep in microseconds (1/1,000,000th of a second)"
msgstr "Podrazumijevano vrijeme mirovanja u mikrosekundama (1/1.000.000 dio sekunde)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Assume elevated"
msgstr "Pretpostavi povišene privilegije"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check this box to assume this device is always elevated"
msgstr "Označite ovo polje da pretpostavite da ovaj uređaj uvijek ima povišene privilegije"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Name of this device type."
msgstr "Naziv ovog tipa uređaja."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Username Prompt"
msgstr "Upit za korisničko ime"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the username prompt to match on login."
msgstr "Ovo je upit za korisničko ime koji se podudara pri prijavi."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Password Prompt"
msgstr "Upit za lozinku"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the password prompt to match on login."
msgstr "Ovo je upit za lozinku koji se podudara pri prijavi."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Configuration file"
msgstr "Konfiguracijska datoteka"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the standard location of the configuration file on the remote device. It is used for SCP and SFTP method"
msgstr "Ovo je standardna lokacija konfiguracijske datoteke na udaljenom uređaju. Koristi se za SCP i SFTP metod"

#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Copy TFTP"
msgstr "Kopiraj TFTP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the CLI text used to send the backup to tftp server."
msgstr "Ovo je CLI tekst koji se koristi za slanje sigurnosne kopije na TFTP server."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Capture Command"
msgstr "Komanda za hvatanje"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional command whose output is saved as the configuration, instead of copying it to a TFTP server. It always runs over SSH, whatever the Connection Type, and the device then needs no TFTP server. Leave blank for devices that copy their configuration to TFTP. Example for MikroTik RouterOS: /export"
msgstr "Opciona komanda čiji se izlaz čuva kao konfiguracija, umjesto kopiranja na TFTP server. Uvijek se izvršava preko SSH-a, bez obzira na Tip veze, i tada uređaju nije potreban TFTP server. Ostavite prazno za uređaje koji svoju konfiguraciju kopiraju na TFTP. Primjer za MikroTik RouterOS: /export"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Show Version"
msgstr "Prikaži verziju"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the CLI text used to display the current version."
msgstr "Ovo je CLI tekst koji se koristi za prikaz trenutne verzije."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Confirmation Prompt"
msgstr "Upit za potvrdu"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the confirmation prompt to match before transmission."
msgstr "Ovo je upit za potvrdu koji se podudara prije prenosa."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Confirm"
msgstr "Potvrda"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Is there a confirmation prompt for copying the config?"
msgstr "Postoji li upit za potvrdu prilikom kopiranja konfiguracije?"

#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Force Confirm"
msgstr "Prisilna potvrda"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Is there a force confirmation prompt for copying the config?"
msgstr "Postoji li upit za prisilnu potvrdu prilikom kopiranja konfiguracije?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check End in Config"
msgstr "Provjeri kraj u konfiguraciji"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check end in config?"
msgstr "Provjeriti kraj u konfiguraciji?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Any Key prompt"
msgstr "Upit za bilo koju tipku"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Text to match a 'Press Any Key To Continue' styled prompt"
msgstr "Tekst za podudaranje s upitom u stilu 'Press Any Key To Continue'"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Post-Login Prompts"
msgstr "Upiti nakon prijave"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional prompt/response pairs sent right after login, before the copy-to-TFTP command, one per line as prompt|response. The prompt is matched as a case-insensitive regular expression against the device output (so it cannot itself contain |, and brackets and other special characters must be escaped, e.g. Save \\[y/n\\]), and the response is sent as typed, or use <CR> to send just a carriage return. A response is only sent once its prompt has been seen, either in the reply to the previous response or in later output; otherwise a warning is logged and nothing is sent. These are answered first; the Any Key prompt above is answered later, while the device is being enabled, so a prompt answered here never reaches Any Key. Example: Press any key|<CR>"
msgstr "Opcioni parovi upit/odgovor koji se šalju odmah nakon prijave, prije komande za kopiranje na TFTP, po jedan u redu u obliku upit|odgovor. Upit se podudara kao regularni izraz neosjetljiv na veličinu slova u odnosu na izlaz uređaja (tako da sam ne može sadržavati |, a zagrade i drugi specijalni znakovi moraju biti izbjegnuti, npr. Save \\[y/n\\]), a odgovor se šalje kako je upisan, ili koristite <CR> za slanje samo znaka za novi red (carriage return). Odgovor se šalje tek nakon što je njegov upit uočen, bilo u odgovoru na prethodni odgovor ili u kasnijem izlazu; u suprotnom se u dnevnik bilježi upozorenje i ništa se ne šalje. Na ove upite se odgovara prvo; na Upit za bilo koju tipku iznad odgovara se kasnije, dok se uređaj omogućava, tako da upit na koji je ovdje odgovoreno nikada ne dospije do upita za bilo koju tipku. Primjer: Press any key|<CR>"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Opće postavke"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Presentation Mode"
msgstr "Način prikaza"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Should Router Configs be presented on the Console or a Top Tab."
msgstr "Da li Konfiguracije rutera trebaju biti prikazane na Konzoli ili na Gornjoj kartici."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Console"
msgstr "Konzola"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Top Tab"
msgstr "Gornja kartica"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Config Diff Context Lines"
msgstr "Linije konteksta za razliku konfiguracija"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The default number of unchanged lines to display before and after each change when comparing two backups. A larger value makes it easier to see the surrounding configuration context. This may be overridden per comparison on the Compare page."
msgstr "Podrazumijevani broj nepromijenjenih linija koje se prikazuju prije i poslije svake izmjene pri poređenju dvije sigurnosne kopije. Veća vrijednost olakšava uvid u okolni kontekst konfiguracije. Ovo se može nadjačati po pojedinačnom poređenju na stranici Poredi."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Connection timeout"
msgstr "Vrijeme isteka veze"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Maximum time to wait in seconds when establishing the initial network connection to a device. A hung or unreachable device is abandoned after this timeout so a scheduled backup run continues with the remaining devices."
msgstr "Maksimalno vrijeme čekanja u sekundama pri uspostavljanju početne mrežne veze s uređajem. Zablokiran ili nedostupan uređaj se napušta nakon ovog isteka vremena kako bi se zakazano pravljenje sigurnosne kopije nastavilo s preostalim uređajima."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Close without exit"
msgstr "Zatvori bez komande exit"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If ticked, when closing down the device connection, no 'exit' command is issued"
msgstr "Ako je označeno, prilikom zatvaranja veze s uređajem neće se izdati komanda 'exit'"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Debug Connection Buffer"
msgstr "Otklanjanje grešaka bafera konekcije"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Whether to log direct output of device connection"
msgstr "Da li zapisivati direktan izlaz konekcije uređaja"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Assume all devices elevated"
msgstr "Pretpostavi da svi uređaji imaju povišene privilegije"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Whether to assume all devices are elevated"
msgstr "Da li pretpostaviti da svi uređaji imaju povišene privilegije"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Download Hour"
msgstr "Sat preuzimanja"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The hour of the day to perform the full downloads."
msgstr "Sat u danu kada se vrše potpuna preuzimanja."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Retry Schedule"
msgstr "Raspored ponovnog pokušaja"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The time to wait before attempting to perform an additional download when scheduled download fails"
msgstr "Vrijeme čekanja prije pokušaja dodatnog preuzimanja kada zakazano preuzimanje ne uspije"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Retention Period"
msgstr "Period čuvanja"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The number of days to retain old backups."
msgstr "Broj dana za čuvanje starih sigurnosnih kopija."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Keep Inactive Device Backups"
msgstr "Zadrži sigurnosne kopije neaktivnih uređaja"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When checked, the retention cleanup will not delete aged-out backups that belong to disabled devices or to devices that have been removed, so configurations for decommissioned or unreachable equipment are retained."
msgstr "Kada je označeno, čišćenje po periodu čuvanja neće obrisati zastarjele sigurnosne kopije koje pripadaju onemogućenim ili uklonjenim uređajima, tako da se konfiguracije za povučenu ili nedostupnu opremu zadržavaju."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Transfer Options"
msgstr "Opcije prijenosa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default connection type"
msgstr "Podrazumijevani tip konekcije"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default type of connection used to communicate with the device."
msgstr "Podrazumijevani tip konekcije koji se koristi za komunikaciju sa uređajem."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Separate By Device"
msgstr "Odvoji po uređaju"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Separate archived Configs into a folder per device"
msgstr "Odvoji arhivirane konfiguracije u folder po uređaju"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Dated Subdirectory"
msgstr "Poddirektorij s datumom"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Insert a date-based subdirectory into the archive path (before the per-device folder), so each run is stored under its backup date, e.g. .../2020-11-04/hostname/.... Off preserves the existing layout."
msgstr "Umeće poddirektorij zasnovan na datumu u putanju arhive (prije foldera za pojedinačni uređaj), tako da se svako pokretanje čuva pod datumom svoje sigurnosne kopije, npr. .../2020-11-04/hostname/.... Isključeno zadržava postojeći raspored."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SCP Path"
msgstr "SCP putanja"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When using SCP, leaving this blank will use PHP's SCP module which does not always work. External SCP is disabled while SSH host key verification is enabled because it cannot reuse the verified connection."
msgstr "Kada koristite SCP, ako ovo ostavite prazno koristit će se PHP-ov SCP modul koji ne radi uvijek. Eksterni SCP je onemogućen dok je uključena provjera SSH ključa hosta jer ne može ponovo koristiti provjerenu konekciju."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Verify SSH Host Keys"
msgstr "Provjeri SSH ključeve hosta"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Record each device's SSH host key on first connect and refuse to send credentials if it later changes. SSH/Telnet mode will not fall back to Telnet while verification is enabled. After a legitimate key change, use the device action to clear the stored host key."
msgstr "Zabilježi SSH ključ hosta svakog uređaja pri prvom povezivanju i odbij slanje podataka za prijavu ako se kasnije promijeni. SSH/Telnet režim se neće vratiti na Telnet dok je provjera omogućena. Nakon opravdane promjene ključa, upotrijebite radnju uređaja za brisanje sačuvanog ključa hosta."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "TFTP Server IP"
msgstr "IP TFTP servera"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Must be an IP pointing to your Cacti server."
msgstr "Mora biti IP adresa koja pokazuje na vaš Cacti server."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "TFTP Backup Directory Path"
msgstr "Putanja direktorija za TFTP sigurnosne kopije"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The path to where your Configs will be backed up, it must be the path that the local TFTP Server writes to."
